<title>UK: Willis Corroon buys Nashville business.</title>
<headline>Willis Corroon buys Nashville business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>International insurance broker Willis Corroon Group Plc said on Friday that it has bought an office in Nashville, Tennessee from Lockton Companies Inc.</p>
<p>It said the cash payment for the business would not exceed $1.8 million.</p>
<p>The business includes twelve people who will relocate to Willis Corroon's existing Nashville location.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
